<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA PANK TO START LATVIAN SECURITIES FIRM.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA PANK TO START LATVIAN SECURITIES FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's fourth largest bank Tallinna Pank said on Thursday that it will start a Latvian securities company.</p>
<p>&quot;Tallinna Pank has established a daughter company Tallinna Pank Securities Latvia with share capital of 30,000 lats,&quot; the bank said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Tallinna gave no details on when the company would start operations.</p>
<p>The bank earlier announced that it has agreed in principle to buy 100 percent of Latvia's Saules Bank but did not say how much it would cost.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
